어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어요." 당신은 <<his>> 눈에 눈물이 고이기 시작하는 것을 본다.
<<if ($genderknown.includes("Sydney") and $settings.nudeGenderPerception gt 0 and $player.sex is C.npc.Sydney.pronoun) or ((!$genderknown.includes("Sydney") or $settings.nudeGenderPerception is 0) and $player.gender_appearance is C.npc.Sydney.pronoun)>>
